    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d140-a1">

                <pb facs="0425" n="374" sameAs="frus:frus1977-80v15/pg374"/>


                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#bold">Memorandum From Secretary of State Vance to President
                        Carter</hi><anchor n="3" xml:id="d140-f1"/>
                </head>
                <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                    <placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1978-11-14"
                        >November 14, 1978</date>
                </dateline>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>Nicaragua: Next Steps</item>
                </list>
                <p>I am attaching a memorandum outlining the options open to us with regard to
                    Nicaragua which reflect our discussion in the PRC meeting November 13.</p>
                <p rendition="#section-heading #italic">Recommendation</p>
                <p>That you approve one of the following options:</p>
                <p rendition="#section-heading #italic">Option 1:</p>
                <p>Explore the feasibility of a plebiscite as a solution to the Nicaraguan
                        crisis.<anchor n="4" xml:id="d140-f2"/></p>
                <p rendition="#section-heading #italic">Option 2:</p>
                <p>Reject plebiscite idea and proceed with demarche to Somoza and supporting
                    measures if necessary.</p>
                <pb facs="0426" n="375" xml:id="pg375"/>
                <p rendition="#section-heading #italic">Option 3:</p>
                <p>Discontinue mediation efforts and return either to business as usual or distance
                    ourselves from the Somoza regime.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d140-f1" n="3" type="source" xml:id="d140-f1-content">
                <p>Secret; Sensitive.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d140-f2" n="4" xml:id="d140-f2-content">
                <p>Carter indicated his approval of Option 1 and placed his first initial in the
                    margin next to the option.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
